@talks pool
topic: news
// TW1, the Talk a while pack: shared pool, topic news. Ship gossip, never news that may not have happened:
// anything about an event, a promotion or an arc needs a condition (plans/talk-pack-plan.md, "Conditions").

== tea-queue
them: Have you heard? There's always something going round.
them: I heard it in the tea queue, so it's half made up.   #funny
ask: Where do you hear the ship's news?
listen: What's the latest, then?
  them: Someone's moving bunks. Big news, here.   #funny
share: Nowhere yet. I'm always last to know.
  them: Stick with me. You'll know everything by Friday.
cheer: I just make it up. Saves time.
  them: That's how half of it starts.   #funny

== gull
when: !who:vance
them: Did you read Gull this week? In the newsletter?
them: The poem about the treadmill. "Thou belt of endless toil."   #funny
ask: Do you read the newsletter?
listen: Who do you think Gull is?
  them: Nobody knows. The guesses get wilder every week.   #funny
share: Sometimes. I like the poems, honestly.
  them: You do? Brave. Don't say it too loudly.   #funny
cheer: Only for Gull. Gull's the best bit.
  them: The best worst bit. Every Friday, I'm there.   #funny

== twins
when: tier>=acquaintance !who:navarro-mateo|salo-saad|nakamura-bilal
them: Did you know three people aboard have twins on the Halcyon?
them: The Halcyon calls them "the set". They find it very funny.
ask: Have you got any brothers or sisters?
listen: Do they look alike?
  them: I've no idea. Nobody's seen the Halcyon lot in ages.   #funny
share: I have family back home. I miss them.
  them: Write to them. Tell them about the Wren. They'll love it.   #warm
cheer: Not that I know of. I'll check.
  them: Do check. Apparently it happens.   #funny

== lost-property
when: tier>=acquaintance !who:navarro-mateo|tran-chloe|fonseca-arjun|grieve-thea
them: There are four lost-property boxes now. On four decks.
them: Four people each think they're the only one in charge.   #funny
ask: Have you lost anything aboard yet?
listen: Does anyone ever get anything back?
  them: Eventually. It might be on Deck 2 by then.   #funny
share: My way, mostly. Every day.
  them: There's no box for that. Ask anyone. They'll walk you.
cheer: My dignity. In the lift.
  them: Nobody's handed that in yet. Keep checking.   #funny

== rumour-true
when: tier>=acquaintance !who:marrow
them: Half the rumours are true. The other half are more fun.   #funny
them: I can never tell which half I've got.
ask: What's the best rumour you've heard so far?
listen: What's the silliest one you've heard?
  them: That the Admiral in the ready room is real. Well. Nobody knows.   #funny
share: I've not heard any good ones yet.
  them: Give it a week. You'll be in one, probably.   #funny
cheer: That the coffee machine has feelings.
  them: Works says it does. Works would know.   #funny

== bunk-moves
when: tier>=acquaintance rank:junior !who:tomas
them: Someone in my bunk room snores. We're having a vote about it.   #funny
them: Not to move them. To buy them a better pillow.
ask: How are your bunkmates? Getting on all right?
listen: Will a pillow help?
  them: No. But it's a nice gesture. That's how we do things.   #funny
share: Really well. I got lucky.
  them: You did. A good bunk room makes the whole ship easier.   #warm
cheer: Tomas talks to the stars. Out loud.
  them: That's lovely, actually. Don't tell him I said so.   #warm

== delivery
when: tier>=acquaintance
them: The store's getting new stock soon. Socks, apparently.
them: Everyone's very excited about the socks.   #funny
ask: What would you want from the store, if you could ask for anything?
listen: Why socks?
  them: The ship eats them. Nobody knows how. Laundry, probably.   #funny
share: Something from home. A taste of it.
  them: Ask the storekeepers. They'll try. They always try.
cheer: More socks. I'm with the ship on this.
  them: The people have spoken. Socks for all.   #funny

== heard-about-you
when: tier>=colleague
them: Can I tell you what I heard about you? It's nice, don't worry.
them: Someone said you're easy to work with. And you say thank you.   #warm
ask: Have you heard anything about yourself yet?
listen: Who said it?
  them: I promised not to say. But they meant it.   #warm
share: No. I'm a bit nervous to, honestly.
  them: Don't be. They're kind about you. I'd tell you otherwise.   #warm
cheer: Only that I eat a lot.
  them: That too. But mostly the nice stuff.   #funny

== messages
when: tier>=colleague !who:tran-chloe|santos-zofia
them: The Comms juniors sort the ship's messages. And they peek at the gossip.   #funny
them: Not the private ones. Just the notice board. They swear.
ask: Do you keep up with your Mail?
listen: Do they really peek?
  them: They say "glance". It's a different word. Same thing.   #funny
share: I try. I'm behind on replies.
  them: Everyone is. Answer one tonight. Just one.
cheer: I read it all, then forget it all.
  them: That's most of us. Your device remembers for you.   #funny

== news-from-home
when: tier>=friend
them: I had some news from home. Good news. Small, but good.
them: Someone I love is doing better. That's all. That's everything.   #warm
ask: Has home had good news for you lately?
listen: Are they all right now?
  them: Getting there. I wanted to tell someone. Thanks for being it.   #warm
share: A little. I'll tell you sometime.
  them: Do. I like hearing it. Good news is better shared.   #warm
cheer: My family finally learned to send Mail.
  them: That's huge, actually. Celebrate it.   #funny
